<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-11-19T14:24:01+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:24:01 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['Families of ministers, officials': BJP alleges AAP links in Punjab PSC selections]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/families-of-ministers-officials-bjp-alleges-aap-links-in-punjab-psc-selections/articleshow/135983564.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135983564.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The BJP on Thursday accused the Bhagwant Mann-led government in Punjab of favouritism and corruption in Punjab Public Service Commission recruitment. BJP MP Sudhanshu Trivedi questioned the selection of 751 candidates for interviews against 331 posts, alleging links between shortlisted candidates and AAP leaders, ministers and officials. He also flagged the high success rate from a single examination centre.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/families-of-ministers-officials-bjp-alleges-aap-links-in-punjab-psc-selections/articleshow/135983564.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/families-of-ministers-officials-bjp-alleges-aap-links-in-punjab-psc-selections/articleshow/135983564.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T14:20:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135983633,imgsize-862068.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Child's spectacle power rising? Myopia may be more than just weak eyesight]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/childs-spectacle-power-rising-myopia-may-be-more-than-just-weak-eyesight/articleshow/135983304.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135983304.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The rise in spectacle power among children could signal a risk for myopia, which might result in future eye problems. Factors such as family genetics, prolonged near-work, and insufficient outdoor playtime play pivotal roles in myopia development. It is recommended that children spend about two hours outside each day to help curb this risk.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/childs-spectacle-power-rising-myopia-may-be-more-than-just-weak-eyesight/articleshow/135983304.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/childs-spectacle-power-rising-myopia-may-be-more-than-just-weak-eyesight/articleshow/135983304.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T14:19:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135983709,imgsize-59920.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: On way to meet Putin, Trump lends helping hand to Xi Jinping on escalator]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-on-way-to-meet-putin-trump-lends-helping-hand-to-xi-jinping-on-escalator/articleshow/135982669.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135982669.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-on-way-to-meet-putin-trump-lends-helping-hand-to-xi-jinping-on-escalator/articleshow/135982669.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-on-way-to-meet-putin-trump-lends-helping-hand-to-xi-jinping-on-escalator/articleshow/135982669.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T14:04:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135983077,imgsize-8383550.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Saif Ali Khan receives death threat from Baba Siddique murder case accused]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/saif-ali-khan-receives-death-threat-from-baba-siddique-murder-case-accused/articleshow/135982382.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135982382.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Bollywood actor Saif Ali Khan has received a death threat from Zeeshan Akhtar, a wanted accused in a murder case. Mumbai Police are now investigating this threat to verify its authenticity. Earlier, actors Tushar Kapoor and Ayushmann Khurrana also received similar threats. Authorities arrested Vaibhav Mishra for allegedly using artificial intelligence to issue these threats. Investigations indicated that Mishra had no connections to any organized crime gang.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/saif-ali-khan-receives-death-threat-from-baba-siddique-murder-case-accused/articleshow/135982382.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/saif-ali-khan-receives-death-threat-from-baba-siddique-murder-case-accused/articleshow/135982382.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T13:59:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135982530,imgsize-82990.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Who can explain this to him?’: Rijiju tears into Rahul Gandhi over ‘dead economy’ jibe]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-can-explain-this-to-him-rijiju-tears-into-rahul-gandhi-over-dead-economy-jibe/articleshow/135982187.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135982187.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-can-explain-this-to-him-rijiju-tears-into-rahul-gandhi-over-dead-economy-jibe/articleshow/135982187.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-can-explain-this-to-him-rijiju-tears-into-rahul-gandhi-over-dead-economy-jibe/articleshow/135982187.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T13:46:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135982496,imgsize-110534.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Punjab and Haryana high court stays Punjab PCS selection process, next hearing on December 16]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/punjab-and-haryana-high-court-stays-punjab-pcs-selection-process-next-hearing-on-december-16/articleshow/135982335.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.ind