-on-hold-candidates-await-clarity/articleshow/135977689.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135977689.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The delay in the NEET-PG 2026 Round 2 results leaves thousands of medical graduates in limbo. As the Medical Counselling Committee awaits direction from the Madras High Court, the postgraduate medical academic calendar, set to commence on November 20, hangs in the balance. Notably, admissions at Sri Venkateshwaraa Medical College are currently on hold per the court’s interim order.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/madras-hc-stay-puts-neet-pg-round-2-result-on-hold-candidates-await-clarity/articleshow/135977689.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/madras-hc-stay-puts-neet-pg-round-2-result-on-hold-candidates-await-clarity/articleshow/135977689.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:14:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135977748,imgsize-81095.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Major KFC franchisee files for bankruptcy protection, may shut more outlets]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/major-kfc-franchisee-files-for-bankruptcy-protection-may-shut-more-outlets/articleshow/135977526.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135977526.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A major KFC franchisee, has filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection citing financial difficulties. The company seeks to restructure its operations and avoid losing its franchise agreement with Yum Brands. Tasty Chick’n has closed 44 restaurant locations this year and may shut down more in the future. The franchisee owes approximately $16 million in unpaid royalties to its parent company, Yum Brands.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/major-kfc-franchisee-files-for-bankruptcy-protection-may-shut-more-outlets/articleshow/135977526.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/major-kfc-franchisee-files-for-bankruptcy-protection-may-shut-more-outlets/articleshow/135977526.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T10:01:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135977545,imgsize-59940.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Revolution, not election’: SP's Azam Khan, on interim bail, predicts 'deluge' in upcoming UP polls]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/revolution-not-election-sps-azam-khan-on-interim-bail-predicts-deluge-in-upcoming-up-polls/articleshow/135977395.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135977395.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Samajwadi Party leader Azam Khan, after receiving interim bail, declared the upcoming Uttar Pradesh Assembly polls a revolution. He criticized constitutional bodies for diminishing public faith and referenced historical educationists to highlight injustice. Khan emphasized that voters will focus on real issues rather than religion and caste in the elections. He expressed readiness to fight for constitutional rights and justice once SP forms a government.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/revolution-not-election-sps-azam-khan-on-interim-bail-predicts-deluge-in-upcoming-up-polls/articleshow/135977395.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/revolution-not-election-sps-azam-khan-on-interim-bail-predicts-deluge-in-upcoming-up-polls/articleshow/135977395.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T09:52:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135977488,imgsize-78992.cms"/></item></channel></rss>